Project: AstroArabia, an Arabic-first Astro starter.

- Keep the document direction RTL by default.
- Use logical CSS properties and Tailwind utilities.
- Use Alexandria for headings and IBM Plex Sans Arabic for body text when available.
- Keep code, URLs, phone numbers, and technical values LTR.
- Prefer accessible semantic HTML and static Astro components.
- Validate with npm run check, npm test, and npm run build.
